# API Gateway

A high-performance API Gateway written in Go.

## Features

- Reverse proxy routing
- API key authentication
- PostgreSQL-backed identity storage
- Request tracing IDs
- Structured logging
- Configuration-driven routing

## Architecture

Client
→ Gateway
→ Authentication
→ Routing
→ Reverse Proxy
→ Backend Services

## Tech Stack

- Go
- PostgreSQL
- Docker
- YAML Configuration

## Running Locally

### Start PostgreSQL

docker run ...

### Configure Environment

DATABASE_URL=...

### Start Gateway

go run ./cmd/gateway

## Health Check

curl http://localhost:8080/health

## Tests

go test ./...

